    <mxCell id="how" value="HOW TO USE THIS TEMPLATE&#10;&#10;This template is SUBTRACTIVE. Start with everything, delete what you do not need.&#10;That is easier than starting blank, because deleting a box forces you to say why.&#10;&#10;1. Rename INPUT and OUTPUT to what they actually are.&#10;2. Open the black box: keep only the inner boxes your system really has.&#10;3. Rename each kept box after its RESPONSIBILITY, never a part you plan to buy.&#10;4. Replace every [ ... ] label with what actually travels, its rate and units.&#10;5. Check nothing draws power with no supply path drawn.&#10;6. Delete this note. Keep the legend." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontColor=#8b949e;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
